      "source": [
        "## Exercises"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "1. Add a `network_egress` field listing allowed external hosts. Refuse runs that touch other hosts.\n2. Extend the checker to fail soft on `docs/**` and hard on `scripts/**`. Justify the asymmetry.\n3. Make the contract derive `allowed_files` from a `goal` field using a static rule set (no LLM). What goes wrong on the first edge case?\n4. Add a `time_budget_minutes` and refuse to continue once the wall clock exceeds it.\n5. Run two contracts against the same diff. What is the right merge semantics when both apply?"
      ]
    }
